		packet loss on a subnet.  If a subnet is expected to be
		lousy, the Robustness Variable may be increased.  IGMP is
		robust to (Robustness Variable-1) packet losses."
	DEFVAL     { 2 }
	--CONFIGURABLE                                                    
	::= { uumEntry 84 }

