-- Added a SYSLOG facility object.
--
-- Revision 1.3  1996/03/27 13:54:09  psd
-- Added CFM support.
--
-- Revision 1.2  1995/12/20 22:56:10  jhalpin
-- Updated event MIB
--
-- Revision 1.1  1995/12/12 02:44:04  jhalpin
-- event handler mib
--
--
--
