         usrfrExtErrLMIUnsolicitedMessage OBJECT-TYPE
             SYNTAX   Counter32
             MAX-ACCESS   read-only
             STATUS   current
             DESCRIPTION
                "Number of unsolicited LMI frames received on 
                 this DLL."
